[157.034903, "o", "\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[157.036955, "o", "python3 evaluate.py --cost\r\n"]
[157.068402, "o", "== Monthly list-price estimate: 2,000 questions a day, 300-character question, 1,500-character article,\r\n   600-character answer, content filters + denied topics + PII + grounding (word and regex filters are free)\r\n\r\nguardContent on the question only (tuned)        units per question {'content': 2, 'topic': 2, 'sensitive': 2, 'grounding': 3}  ->  $66.00 a month\r\nno guardContent: question + article evaluated    units per question {'content': 3, 'topic': 3, 'sensitive': 3, 'grounding': 3}  ->  $90.00 a month\r\n\r\nPrices: aws.amazon.com/bedrock/pricing (read 22 Oct 2026). Model tokens are extra; a blocked prompt costs the guardrail evaluation but no model call.\r\n"]
[157.073269, "o", "\u001b[?2004h\u001b]0;thesecguy@lab: ~/ai-security-course-labs/labs/m12\u0007\u001b[01;32mthesecguy@lab\u001b[00m:\u001b[01;34m~/ai-security-course-labs/labs/m12\u001b[00m$ "]
