[166.028843, "o", "e"]
[166.516342, "o", "\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[166.518336, "o", "python3 enforce.py --role first-draft --org first-draft\r\n"]
[166.55791, "o", "== Helpdesk role: helpdesk-role.first-draft.json   |   org Bedrock policy: first-draft\r\n\r\nR1 approved call                          ALLOWED  tsghelpdesk01:1 on the prompt; org baseline BROKEN: identifier has no numeric version (AWS: the version cannot be DRAFT)\r\nR2 no guardrail                           ALLOWED  org baseline BROKEN: identifier has no numeric version (AWS: the version cannot be DRAFT)\r\nR3 DRAFT version                          ALLOWED  tsghelpdesk01 on the prompt; org baseline BROKEN: identifier has no numeric version (AWS: the version cannot be DRAFT)\r\nR4 another team's weak guardrail          ALLOWED  devnofilters:3 on the prompt; org baseline BROKEN: identifier has no numeric version (AWS: the version cannot be DRAFT)\r\nR5 user text left outside guardContent    ALLOWED  tsghelpdesk01:1 on ONLY the harmless tagged sentence; org baseline BROKEN: identifier has no numeric version (AWS: the version cannot be DRAFT)\r\nR6 bedrock-mantle endpoint                ALLOWED  NONE: Guardrails is not supported on bedrock-mantle\r\n\r\nCalls that reach a model with the user's text unguarded: 3 of 6 (R2, R5, R6)\r\n"]
