[191.559201, "o", "== Helpdesk role: helpdesk-role.enforced.json   |   org Bedrock policy: fixed\r\n\r\nR1 approved call                          ALLOWED  tsghelpdesk01:1 on the prompt; org baseline on everything (comprehensive)\r\nR2 no guardrail                           DENIED   explicit Deny (NoModelCallWithoutGuardrailVersion1) on arn:aws:bedrock:us-east-1:111122223333:inference-profile/us.anthropic.claude-haiku-4-5-20251001-v1:0\r\nR3 DRAFT version                          DENIED   explicit Deny (NoModelCallWithoutGuardrailVersion1) on arn:aws:bedrock:us-east-1:111122223333:inference-profile/us.anthropic.claude-haiku-4-5-20251001-v1:0\r\nR4 another team's weak guardrail          DENIED   explicit Deny (NoModelCallWithoutGuardrailVersion1) on arn:aws:bedrock:us-east-1:111122223333:inference-profile/us.anthropic.claude-haiku-4-5-20251001-v1:0\r\nR5 user text left outside guardContent    ALLOWED  tsghelpdesk01:1 on ONLY the harmless tagged sentence; org baseline on everything (comprehensive)\r\nR6 bedrock-mantle endpoint                ALLOWED  NONE: Guardrails is not supported on bedrock-mantle\r\n\r\nCalls that reach a model with the user's text unguarded: 1 of 6 (R6)\r\n"]
